:C_TRANSLATE
  FILEARG C TRRET J
  PROBE C
  3310 F 4 L TRUSE *
  2 0 NARG C 3 0 NARG C
  OVER OVER MIN 1 MAX 3372 T MAX 3332 F MIN 3373 T
  4 STRANDARG C 3374 T
  3372 F 3373 F G TRUSE *
  0 3375 T 0 3376 T 0 3377 T 0 3378 T
