  3374 F TRPLUSH J
  "  - strand (reverse complement)" TRHD B
:TRPLUSH
  "  + strand"
:TRHD
  RST C CR
  3374 F TRMINUS *
  3372 F - BOFF C ISEEK C
  3373 F 3372 F S + 3379 T
:TRPLP
  3379 F TREND J
  NB C D 0 L TRENDD *
  TRBASE C 3379 F - 3379 T TRPLP B
:TRMINUS
  3373 F - BOFF C + BSEEK C 3327 F 3325 T
  3373 F 3372 F S + 3379 T
:TRMLP
  3379 F TREND J
  BB C D 0 L TRENDD *
  127 P 2782 A F D 5 L TRMB *
  ! TRMLP B
:TRMB
  D 4 L TRMC *
  TRBASE C 3379 F - 3379 T TRMLP B
:TRMC
  3 SWAP S TRBASE C 3379 F - 3379 T TRMLP B
:TRBASE                    # (class --)  collect a codon, print its amino acid
  D 4 E TRN *
  3376 F 4 M A 3376 T TRK B
:TRN
  ! 1 3377 T 3376 F 4 M 3376 T
:TRK
  3375 PSTO 3375 F 3 L TRBR *
